OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome limited
OL,6,Fclear spells but otherwise a cloudy
OL,7,Fevening and night. Most dry, but the
OL,8,Fodd light shower may crop up over
OL,9,FShetland. Southwest winds moderate
OL,10,Facross Shetland.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FSimilar to Tuesday with
OL,13,Fmost staying dry, but probably a
OL,14,Flittle more brightness breaking
OL,15,Fthrough. Winds light and variable in
OL,16,Fdirection.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FThe
OL,19,Fpattern remains unchanged with a
OL,20,Flargely dry and occasionally bright
OL,21,Ffare, coupled with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
